        "intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Intro",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>One independent Toronto Raptors publication, a basketball podcast that also plays live, and a tennis strand with a weekly show of its own. This is where the network's coverage goes once hockey and baseball are accounted for.</p><p>A smaller catalogue than hockey's, and deliberately so. Each brand here keeps its own name, its own editors and its own audience rather than becoming a section of somebody else's site.</p>",
