      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "raptorsrepublic.com",
        "heading": "Toronto Raptors news, stats and analysis",
        "text": "<p>Raptors Republic has long been regarded as a leading destination for high-quality Raptors analysis, commentary and fan engagement, built on a philosophy of community through sports. Its content and operations team stayed in place when it joined the network, and the paywall came down, so the whole site is open to every reader.</p><p>Around the game itself sit editorials, film breakdowns and roster analysis, plus <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/ca/podcast/the-rapcast/id736333342\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Rapcast</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/raptorsrepublic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a YouTube channel</a> and <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QvqPA2xjm6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a Discord</a> where the argument carries on between games.</p>",
        "button_label": "Visit raptorsrepublic.com",
        "button_link": "https://raptorsrepublic.com/",
        "image_position": "left",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48,
        "stock_image": "crowd",
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.color3 }}"
      }
    },
