      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Follow the show",
        "heading": "Where to find Hello and Welcome",
        "body": "<p>Everything the show puts out has a home, and the merch has one too.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@hellowelcomepod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube</a></li><li><a href=\"https://shows.acast.com/hello-and-welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Acast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nationgear.ca/collections/hello-and-welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nation Gear</a></li></ul>",
